{"id":"profesio_n","lemma":"profesión","pos":"noun","rank":2599,"glosses":["profession","calling"],"ipa":"/pɾofeˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"profesiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/45/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-profesi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Enseñar inglés es su profesión.","en":"Teaching English is his profession.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831156","words":[{"g":"to teach"},{"g":"English"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Su profesión es enseñar inglés.","en":"Teaching English is his profession.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to teach"},{"g":"English"}]},{"text":"Sea cual sea tu profesión y lo feliz que seas en ella, habrá momentos en los que desearás haber elegido otra carrera.","en":"No matter what your profession, or how happy you may be in it, there are moments when you wish you had chosen some other career.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692579","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"suchlike"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"happy, merry"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"moment, instant","l":"momento"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to wish","l":"desear"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"chosenness, selectness"},{"g":"someone else","l":"otro"},{"g":"race"}]}]}